### Create a MESSAGE notification
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "06dde16f-482d-4965-be69-8b852934c685",
  "type": "MESSAGE",
  "payload": "You have a new message from Ahmed about 'Modern Villa in Casablanca'"
}

###

### Create an ALERT notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "06dde16f-482d-4965-be69-8b852934c685",
  "type": "ALERT",
  "payload": "Your property listing 'Apartment in Rabat' has been approved"
}

###

### Create a BOOKING notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "06dde16f-482d-4965-be69-8b852934c685",
  "type": "BOOKING",
  "payload": "A viewing has been scheduled for your property on March 1st at 3:00 PM"
}

###

### Create a PRICE_DROP notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "06dde16f-482d-4965-be69-8b852934c685",
  "type": "PRICE_DROP",
  "payload": "A property you saved dropped in price from $250,000 to $210,000"
}

###

### Create a SYSTEM notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "06dde16f-482d-4965-be69-8b852934c685",
  "type": "SYSTEM",
  "payload": "Your account has been verified successfully. Welcome to Homely!"
}

###

### Get all unread notifications for this user
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread?userId=06dde16f-482d-4965-be69-8b852934c685

